Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 20:37:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Second-opinion follow-up for the public form hardening

Mirror of the platform follow-up (tests live in mission-community-nte-platform):
stricter website check that no longer accepts "https://N/A"-style values,
submit control enabled only after each form's set-up has finished, a short
noscript notice on each NTE form, and the volunteer pages left as they were.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
